OL,4,BLampard calls for fairness after       
OL,5,BCoventry penalty row                   
OL,6,GFrustrated Frank Lampard has called    
OL,7,Gfor fairness from officials after      
OL,8,GCoventry were denied a clear penalty - 
OL,9,Gwith the boss claiming it got less     
OL,10,Gcoverage because they are a smaller    
OL,11,Gclub.                                  
OL,13,FThe Sky Blues were furious they were   
OL,14,Fnot awarded a first-half spot kick in  
OL,15,Fthe 3-1 defeat at Everton before the   
OL,16,Finternational break.                   
